  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "38201",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Eclipse Tribe at Dadaupa Gorge",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3820101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3820101": {
            "id": "3820101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There are too many enemies ahead! <color=#00E1FFFF>Attacking</color> them head on would be too dangerous. Maybe we can creep down <color=#00E1FFFF>either side</color> to sneak past."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "38202",
      "subQuestName": "Open the chest to obtain Dvalin's Tear",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3820201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3820201": {
            "id": "3820201",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "This search reminds me of a feud I once had with the Fatui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "38201",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3820102"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3820102": {
            "id": "3820102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Our only objective is the Teardrop Crystal. Should we <color=#00E1FFFF>attack them head-on</color> or <color=#00E1FFFF>sneak inside</color>? It's up to you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "38202",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3820202"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3820202": {
            "id": "3820202",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Six months ago, a thief stole treasure from the East Temple of the Four Winds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820203"
            ]
          },
          "3820203": {
            "id": "3820203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa. What was it? A cup used by Barbatos?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820204"
            ]
          },
          "3820204": {
            "id": "3820204",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "No. Although if such a thing existed, it would be very valuable.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820205"
            ]
          },
          "3820205": {
            "id": "3820205",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Among all the relics they managed to dig up, one particular object was very rare...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820206"
            ]
          },
          "3820206": {
            "id": "3820206",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "It was a vial which contained the Anemo God's breath.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820207"
            ]
          },
          "3820207": {
            "id": "3820207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Relics come in every shape and form huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820208"
            ]
          },
          "3820208": {
            "id": "3820208",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Anyone with an eye for fine art would like to add this relic to their collection.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820209"
            ]
          },
          "3820209": {
            "id": "3820209",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Once word got out, the Fatui started trying to seek it out as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820210"
            ]
          },
          "3820210": {
            "id": "3820210",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "They've made tons of counterfeits that can be found everywhere.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820211"
            ]
          },
          "3820211": {
            "id": "3820211",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "In response, I just bought every one I could find, irrespective of its authenticity. We're still at it now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820212"
            ]
          },
          "3820212": {
            "id": "3820212",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "I've bought more than two thousand fakes to date, and the Fatui are yet to find the real one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820213"
            ]
          },
          "3820213": {
            "id": "3820213",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa. You guys are insane...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820214"
            ]
          },
          "3820214": {
            "id": "3820214",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, it means that the real one must be out there somewhere on the black market, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820215"
            ]
          },
          "3820215": {
            "id": "3820215",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmmm... Paimon'll give you a discount on them if she finds any — cause Paimon's just great like that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820216"
            ]
          },
          "3820216": {
            "id": "3820216",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Sure, you can try to find the real one. I'll take what you find, even if they're fake.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3820217"
            ]
          },
          "3820217": {
            "id": "3820217",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Once you're done, find me at the winery. I'll trade you a beer for every 20 you find."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}